users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\niPhone SE (2nd generation), iOS 18.6.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter upgrading to Godot 4.6, apps exported with the **Mobile renderer** (`renderer/rendering_method=\"mobile\"`) fail Metal API Validation and abort on launch on iPhone SE 2nd generation. The same project works without issues on Godot 4.5.1.\n\n**Expected behavior:** The app should launch and run normally on iPhone SE 2nd generation, as it did with Godot 4.5.1.\n\n**Actual behavior:** The app aborts on startup with a Metal API Validation failure:\n\n```\nvalidateMTLSamplerDescriptor:76: failed assertion `Sampler Descriptor Validation\nMTLSamplerBorderColorTransparentBlack is not supported on this device\n```\n\n<img width=\"529\" height=\"561\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f830e6dc-73a0-4f3d-a74e-e41b2d99c466\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached minimal reproduction project in Godot 4.6\n2. Export the project for iOS (the project is already configured with Mobile renderer)\n3. Open the exported Xcode project and run it on an iPhone SE 2nd generation **via Xcode debugger** (Debug run)\n4. Observe that the app aborts with a Metal API Validation failure (`MTLSamplerBorderColorTransparentBlack is not supported on this device`)\n\n**Note:** Simply building and deploying without Xcode debugger may not surface this error. The Metal API Validation assertion is triggered when running under Xcode's debug session.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[se2-crash-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25179061/se2-crash-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116090/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116090/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}